      },
      "judge": {},
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "failure": "Original sentence has no exact-span item or proven chatter marker",
          "recovery": "Coverage refuses preparation/submission; repair parser without dropping text"
        },
        {
          "failure": "Costly reference has multiple or no candidates",
          "recovery": "Review target before submission; context grants no permission"
        }
      ],
      "frontier": [
        "Conservative spans are reading aids, not proof of semantic interpretation.",
        "Model extraction and automatic edit-learning are disabled.",
        "Open files and recent work need bounded supplied context; chat comes from selected broker.",
        "References outside the bounded chat projection can remain unresolved; a candidate is not an exact target."
      ],
      "guidance": [
        "Original text remains saved verbatim; later corrections affect only named asks.",
        "Offsets are Unicode code points. Unknown clauses remain visible context.",
        "Minimal is the measured C14f default. Agent text contains only original wording with marked heard/ref readings; inlineEdits holds exact source spans and before/after text for reversal.",
        "Checklist, checks, constraints, assumptions, questions and CL context pointers stay in the saved prompt.get record and Paul card; they are not appended on automatic sends.",
        "Raw and full remain explicit variant options for audited comparison. Full uses the historical CL reading aid; raw emits the original unchanged.",
        "A trailing not remains a visible card assumption and cannot cancel another explicit ask. Consequential ambiguous targets still block sends.",
        "An owner card edit appends only fields Paul explicitly changed and answered questions; unchanged card fields never become prompt overhead.",
        "C14f five tasks twice: strict intent minimal17/raw16/full14 of22; consumer tokens153139/181006/168734. Small reused panel with four unchanged task prompts is not population or causal gain evidence."
      ]
    },
